      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋirorwa a ŋisacaradotin ka ŋilepi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae lu ŋisacaradotin ka ŋilepi ŋulu aboŋunete ka Serubabel lokoku a Sealtiel ta Yesua: Seraia, Yeremia, Esira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaria, Maluk, Atus, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sekania, Reum, Meremos, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido, Genesoi, Abiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mijamin, Maadia, Biliga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Semaia, Yoiarib, Yedaia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salu, Amok, Ilikia, Yedaia. Arae ŋul ŋikarikok a ŋisacaradotin ka a ŋirukitos keŋ alorwa a ŋulu a Yesua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋilepi ŋulu aboŋunete kaapei ka Serubabel ta Yesua ikes lu: Binui, Kadimel, Serabia, Yuda ka Matania, arae Metania ka ŋirukitos keŋ apolokinito ŋieosyo ŋulu ka alakar neni ka Akuj ka arae ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakubukia ka Uni ta ŋirukitos kec aboonokin ka ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae Yesua papa a Yoiakim, arae Yoiakim papa a Eliasib, arae Eliasib papa a Yoiada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arae Yoiada papa a Yonasan ka arae Yonasan papa a Yadua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alorwa a ŋulu a Yoiakim a esacaradoti ŋulu apolokinito ŋatekerin ikes lu: Anateker a Seraia arae Meraia apolokinit, anateker a Yeremia arae Anania apolokinit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anateker a Esira arae Mesulam apolokinit, anateker ka Amaria arae Yeoianan apolokinit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anateker a Maluki arae Yonasan apolokinit, anateker a Sebania arae Yosepu apolokinit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anateker ka Arim arae Adina apolokinit, anateker a Meraios arae Elikai apolokinit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anateker a Ido arae Sakariya apolokinit, anateker a Gineson arae Mesulam apolokinit ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anateker ka Abia arae Sikiri apolokinit, anateker a Miniamin ka Moadia arae Pilitai apolokinit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anateker a Biliga arae Samua apolokinit, anateker a Semaia arae Yeonasan apolokinit; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anateker a Yoiarib arae Matenai apolokinit, anateker a Yedaia arae Usi apolokinit ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anateker a Salai arae Kala apolokinit, anateker ka Amok arae Eber apolokinit ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anateker a Ilikia arae Asabia apolokinit, anateker a Yedaia arae Nasaniel apolokinit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alorwa a ŋulu ka Eliasib, Yoiada, Nasanael, Yoanan ka Yadua, egiritae ŋirorwa a ŋikapolokinitok a ŋatekerin a ŋilepi ka a ŋisacaradotin daŋ akitodol apaki ŋina epukator erwosit Darius Perisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egiritae ŋirorwa a ŋikapolok a ŋatekerin a ŋilepi lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwa akitodol ŋirwa ŋulu a Yoanan a lokoku ka Eliasib. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae lu ŋikapolokinitok a ŋilepi: Asabia, Serabia, Yesua, lokoku a Kadimiel. Ŋirukitos kec ŋulu aboonokin ka ikes aeore ŋieosyo ŋulukipuret ka ŋulu ka alakar neni ka Akuj, lopite ŋolo ecikitor Daudi ŋolo arae ituŋanan ŋini ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae Matania, Akibukia, Obadia, Mesulam, Talimon ka Akub ŋiketeok ŋipukei, eyokiyete ikes ŋakais ŋuna eŋadatae ŋiboro alopukei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyaete ŋul etic ŋol alorwa a ŋulu a Yoiakim a lokoku a Yesua, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Yosadak ka alorwa a ŋulu epukator Neemia ta alorwa a ŋulu a Esira esacaradoti a ŋolo arae eketataman a ŋikisila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kitaleunoe arwatata ŋina ke etaun",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋina etaleunere arwatata ŋina a Yerusalem, aponi kiwarunae ŋilepi anakiboisyo kec, yaunae Yerusalem aŋuna ka akinumunum ŋasuban ŋuna italeunere arwatata analelyanu ka analakara eoi eramio ŋitworoi, ŋaduŋui ka ŋagitae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋatuketa a ŋikaeok tocununos anakiboisyo a ŋuna alodiyete Yerusalem ka alorerya a Ŋinetopiasi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka alorerya a Bes-Gilgal ka anakiboisyo a Geba ta Asimepes, apote ikes anakiboisyo a ŋun, anerae adukito ŋikaeok a ŋuna kec ŋirerya nakiboisyo ŋuna alodiyete Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi, apotu ŋisacaradotin ka ŋilepi kitaleunos, ido kitaleut ŋituŋa, ka ŋipukei ta arwatata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
