          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ayoŋ oya ŋikarikok a ŋiletok a Yuda etipeiyorya ikes kidiama arwatata, ido oseu ŋatuketa ŋaarei ŋuna apolok, ŋuna elosete akirimor etaun ka alakar neni ka Akuj. Abu atukot apei kitor lowae ŋolo aloteten ŋolo ka epuke a ŋolo ka Aoret, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ewuapito ŋituŋa lu ikes: Osaia ka atutubet apei ŋina a ŋikarikok a ŋiletok a Yuda ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka Asaria, Esira, Mesulam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda, Benjamin, Semaia ka Yeremia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arukito daŋ ikes ka ŋisacaradotin ŋice ŋulu asorokanak ŋulu ekusete ŋarupepe, ŋisacaradotin ŋul ikes lu: Sakariya lokoku Yonasan, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Semaia, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Matania, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Mikaia, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Sekur, a ŋolo arae lokoku ka Asap ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka arukito Sakariya ka ŋiyeneta keŋ lu: Semaia, Asarael, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Nasaniel, Yuda ka Anani, atiŋito ŋul ŋiboro ŋulu eore ŋulu a Daudi a ŋolo arae ituŋanan ŋini ka Akuj, ido kiŋarenikinite ikes Esira ŋolo arae esacaradoti ka eketataman a ŋikisila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edolete lopuke ŋolo a Elelya, kitipeiyosi anadoketa a ŋuna alotaun a Daudi, neni ikyaaror alokidiama akai a Daudi, todolo lopuke ŋolo a Ŋakipi ŋolo ayai Kide etaun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
