            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi, kitor atukot ŋinace lowae ŋolo alo kedyeny, ido abu ayoŋ ewuapak ikes erukitoe ka atutubet apei a ŋituŋa, omekisi arwatata alokidiama aduketait ŋina aoyan ŋina a ekitet tari narwatata ŋina Aburon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kitoroi kidiama epuke ŋolo a Epuraim, kitoroi diyete Epuke ŋolo Ŋorot ka diyete Epuke ŋolo a Ŋikolya ka diyete aduketait ŋina aoyan ŋina ka Ananel ka diyete aduketait ŋina aoyan ŋina Amiat tari lopuke ŋolo a Ŋamesekin, ido abu atukot ŋin towo alopuke a ŋolo a ŋiketeok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu ŋatuketa ŋunaarei daadaŋ ŋuna alakar neni ka Akuj, towua alo Kai ka Akuj, ayai ayoŋ daŋ nen kaapei ka atutubet apei ŋina a ŋikapolokinitok a ŋituŋa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ta ŋisacaradotin lu: Eliakim, Maaseia, Miniamin Mikaia, Elioenai, Sakariya ka Anania, atiŋito ŋisacaradotin ŋul ŋarupepe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aya daŋ nen ŋisacaradotin lu: Maaseia, Semaia, Eleasar, Usi, Yeoanan, Maliciya, Elam ka Ezer, ido aeosi ŋikaeok epolokinit Yesiraia ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ikes inakis akoloŋit ŋin ŋamuronisya ŋuna alalak alelyanu, anerae abu Akuj inak ikes alelyanu ŋina apolon, apotu ŋaberu ka ŋidwe daŋ tolelyana. Apedori ituŋanan akiirar aneni alwanan ecelet ŋolo ka alyelyanu a ŋituŋa a Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo alo Kai ka Akuj",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋin aponi toseunae ŋikilyok apolokin ŋagulei ŋuna iŋadao ŋiboro lu: Ŋainakineta, ŋaraito ŋuna a ekiŋaren ka ŋatutubeta ŋapeipei alotooma ŋitomon a ŋiboro; arae etic kec acununun nagulei ŋun ŋiboro ŋulu elimunit ekisil yaunae aŋuna a ŋisacaradotin ka ŋilepi alomanikorin a ŋulu a ŋituŋa a ŋulu eboiyete alotaunio, anerae alakara ŋituŋa a Yudaya aŋuna a ŋisacaradotin ka ŋilepi ŋulu etiyaete etic alo Kai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyaete ikes etic ŋolo a Akuj kec ka ŋolo kitaleununuyet, etiyaete ŋikaeok ka ŋiketeok ŋipukei daŋ ŋiticisyo kec lopite ŋolo ecikitor Daudi ka lokoku keŋ Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alorwa a ŋulu a Daudi ka Asap, ŋirwa ŋulu koloŋ, ayai ekarikon a ŋikaeok ka ŋolo a ŋiketeok ŋipukei ka ayakasi ŋieosyo ŋulukipuret ka ŋulu ka alakar neni ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alorwa a ŋulu a Serubabel ka alorwa a ŋulu a Neemia ayaununeete a ŋinakoloŋit Ŋisirael daadaŋ ŋainakineta aŋuna a ŋikaeok ka a ŋiketeok ŋipukei. Atyakanarete ikes ŋiboro aŋuna a ŋilepi, ido atyakanarete ŋilepi ŋiboro ŋulu amaikina erae ŋulu a ŋiletok ka Aron.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
